{"v":4,"catch":"Hypertension 是 Erik Games 開發的快速挑戰反射遊戲","desc":"這款單人遊戲不斷挑戰您的反應能力，您將在八張獨特的地圖上發揮才能。要將你的名字寫進冠軍榜，你需要足夠快才能通過不斷緊張的地圖比賽。利用你的內心直覺和經驗來通過地圖。有時要小心，每張地圖都會衡量您不同的快速反應能力。與時間競爭，享受樂趣！\n主要特點\n  -八張獨特的地圖\n- 不斷挑戰時間和速度\n  - 將你的名字寫入排行榜\n-與時間賽跑","publisher":"Erik Games","release":"2023-07-20","genres":["街機","動作","訓練","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a316a495268bdd8ee61b2c96c984a36478135e22042d1840ad4bf5125738ade5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d38969eab603c4472f7623a9b888170fd5e45dd736e1bb29cccfe34f7cb901da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2d403daf9ad228b1c1ba62a6d75e5d283887f63db871a517f5edb5b36edb238.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8aea43c531c43c3375a0ae8399242599270901732a74ed7f5c3749a08ec4e0fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1eecaada1d76abdc56aab9ac08750abb80a93fae0829ae4646ee52f3ea94855.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0307a173292f1a124bbf9539d061bcdc57310bf71c39fbdd4534e685042d2243.jpg"],"titleId":"010049101be84000","dlc":[]}